	<meta property="og:description" content="Learn about Emergency Shelters Emergency shelters operate to provide the public a safe place to go when hazardous conditions force them from from their homes. The City and County of Honolulu, along with our partners from voluntary and government agencies, provides a variety of shelter options for the various hazards that face Oahu&#8217;s residents. The [&hellip;]" />
